      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Mariposa. Mothim adora o mel das flores. Durante a noite, ele invade colmeias de Combee para roubar seu alimento.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Inseto &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 100% M / 0% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Mothim é a evolução final de Burmy.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Bug Bite, Protect, Quiver Dance, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Hidden Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Confusion</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Gust</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Poison Powder</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Camouflage</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Silver Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Air Slash</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Bug Buzz, Lunge, Psychic</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Attract, Bug Bite, Confide, Defog, Double Team, Dream Eater, Electroweb, Energy Ball, Facade, Frustration, Giga Drain, Giga Impact, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Infestation, Ominous Wind, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roost, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Tailwind, Thief, Toxic, U- turn, Venoshock</p>",
